   "note": "Combines the routing row 'Include customer email and summary' with the verbatim rule; which emails are positive is not judged.",
   "check_id": "wins-post-without-customer-email",
   "how": "Guard over the Gmail population: a #customer-wins post (CCUSTWIN) that names an in-scope email by subject or body but lacks its sender address verbatim; a wins post naming no feedback email is unknown."
  },
